# Golden raster INPUTS are regenerated deterministically (seeded) by
# ../../../scripts/vectorize/make_goldens.py — the generator is the source of truth,
# so the heavy noise-bearing PNGs (~1.5MB each) are not tracked. Run:
#   python3 scripts/vectorize/make_goldens.py
# to recreate them, then calibrate.py / vectorize.py against them. The traced OUTPUTS
# (../*.svg) and the calibration report ARE tracked.
*.png
